    "self_improve_constraints": "【本次执行约束 — 由前置资产合并生成】\n\n【用户偏好】\n# Rules\n- foo\n\n【关联 Skill】\n  - 调研方法论 (research_methodology): 调研方法论：目标明确、多渠道信息收集、交叉验证、分析综合与结论提炼。通用调研能力，不绑定特定交付模板。\n    路径: business/skills/research_methodology/SKILL.md\n  - 竞品分析方法论 (competitive-analysis-methodology): 竞品分析方法论：六步闭环流程（目标→选品→维度→采集→分析→结论），定性+定量结合。通用竞品分析能力，不绑定特定交付模板。\n    路径: business/skills/competitive-analysis-methodology/SKILL.md\n  - 自定义调研指南 (custom-survey): 根据指定主题做桌面调研，输出背景分析和结论\n    路径: business/skills/custom-survey/SKILL.md\n  - 产品方法论 (product-methodology): 产品交付方法论：问题空间、用户场景、范围边界、可验证验收与优先级排序。\n    路径: business/skills/product-methodology/SKILL.md\n  - 工程最佳实践 (engineering-best-practices): SOLID 原则、Clean Code、测试金字塔、CI/CD 质量门禁与最小 diff 原则\n    路径: business/skills/engineering-best-practices/SKILL.md\n\n【参考知识库】\n  - rubric:/research:step-collect: agent:  task_type: research task_id: step-collect project_id: ui_团队协作端到端测试3_20260701_061241 rubric_score: 87.50 rubric_passed: yes 维度问题：结论可执行:缺少关键词：建议, 行动, 下一步 评分明细： 模板: research 阈值: 0.70 加权得分: 0.8750\n  - quality:/research:step-collect: agent:  task_type: research task_id: step-collect project_id: ui_团队协作端到端测试3_20260701_061241 attempts: 1 quality_score: 0.92 gate_passed: yes review: skipped status: completed\n  - quality:research/research:t2: agent: research task_type: research task_id: t2 project_id: team-eval-1782906471 attempts: 1 quality_score: 0.92 gate_passed: yes review: skipped status: needs_review\n  - rubric:research/research:t2: agent: research task_type: research task_id: t2 project_id: team-eval-1782906471 rubric_score: 93.80 rubric_passed: yes 维度问题：分析深度:缺少关键词：对比, 劣势, 差异 评分明细： 模板: research 阈值: 0.70 加权得分: 0.9375   调研框架: 1.00\n  - quality:research/competitive-analysis:t1: agent: research task_type: competitive-analysis task_id: t1 project_id: team-eval-1782906471 attempts: 1 quality_score: 0.93 gate_passed: yes review: skipped status: needs_review\n  - rubric:research/competitive-analysis:t1: agent: research task_type: competitive-analysis task_id: t1 project_id: team-eval-1782906471 rubric_score: 100.00 rubric_passed: yes 评分明细： 模板: research 阈值: 0.70 加权得分: 1.0000   调研框架: 1.000   数据来源: 1.00\n\n【质量标准 — 红线】\n  - 禁止编造无来源数据（行业数据须标注报告/官网来源）\n  - 流程图须用结构化 DSL（Mermaid/PlantUML/Graphviz），纯 ASCII → 缺陷\n  - 重复检索阈值 N 按偏好配置，仅语义无新增信息算冗余\n  - 必须覆盖异常场景和边界条件\n"
